["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"73. AGI範式大轉移：和廣密預言草莓、OpenAI o1和self-play RL｜全球大模型季報4 Self-Play RL Scaling Law reward model RLHF MOE DiT\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-09-05-zhangxiaojun-不做强化学习的公司-下一波浪潮里可能跑不出来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjRul75Gm9ZxrQhlHRKC87dFMPZK.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0905</span></div>\n<h2>不做強化學習的公司，下一波浪潮裡可能跑不出來</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">語言預訓練遇到瓶頸後，硅谷最核心的幾百名研究者已把資源壓注到 self-play RL 上，它用推理算力換訓練算力，讓模型自己探索出邏輯推理能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">強化學習</span><span class=\"tag\">AGI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"71. 和樓天城聊聊Robotaxi和ACRush：“L2做得越厲害，離L4越遠” contest based metric system MPX Hold hard end-to-end BEV Robotaxi\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-08-16-zhangxiaojun-l2做得越好离l4越远-无人驾驶的路线之争/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FijCCeg-AtdrraFAzp9YRINjJjYm.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0816</span></div>\n<h2>L2做得越好離L4越遠，無人駕駛的路線之爭</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">小馬智行樓天城認為 L2 和 L4 目標不同：L2 用戶只要夠用、成本更低，做得越好反而離 L4 越遠；L4 要的是萬小時不出事，還得有一把評價好壞的尺子。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自動駕駛</span><span class=\"tag\">Robotaxi</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"70. 和何小鵬聊，FSD、“在血海游泳”、亂世中的英雄與狗熊 AD BOM Robot Taxi OTA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-07-16-zhangxiaojun-何小鹏-大模型对小型公司不利-越强越多数据越多费用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp37paOfurFYgBWp_EbRXFO7g6Oy.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0716</span></div>\n<h2>何小鵬：大模型對小型公司不利，越強越多數據越多費用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大 AI 的網絡效應是：越強所以越多數據，越多數據所以越多費用，越多費用所以要賣越多車去支持這個體系。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自動駕駛</span><span class=\"tag\">大模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"69. 口述全球大模型這半年：Perplexity突然火爆和尚未爆發的AI應用生態 PMF RAG MOE Scaling Law Latency\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-06-23-zhangxiaojun-ai应用没爆发-不是产品问题是模型问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpV5S2s16zFcCRjqgYa2pwIeYoi0.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0623</span></div>\n<h2>AI應用沒爆發，不是產品問題是模型問題</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">GPT-4 出來一年多，硅谷主流 VC 投出的 AI 應用只有 Perplexity 一家跑到 2000 多萬月活；90% 的原因是只基於 GPT-4 的能力不夠，只能做信息組合，做不了長距離推理。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 應用</span><span class=\"tag\">Perplexity</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"68. 和MiniMax天使投資人聊，MiniMax幕後故事和大模型資本撲克牌 Club Deal corner cases MOE scale up L4\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-06-10-zhangxiaojun-minimax-第一位投资人-大厂降价是看牌-创业公司只能认赔/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FokwP40bx9IT4Ltfie4LFailgu_D.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0610</span></div>\n<h2>MiniMax 第一位投資人：大廠降價是看牌，創業公司只能認賠</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大廠做模型可以不賺錢、從雲計算把錢掙回來，創業公司被拖進價格戰卻無處回血；MiniMax 的解法是模型質量第一，靠海外 2C 產品收錢。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">融資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"67. 談談黃仁勳搭建的組織系統：分布式操作系統，“就像一臺GPU” Conway&#x27;s Law context, not control Zero Billion Dollar Market chiplet\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-05-31-zhangxiaojun-英伟达没有五年计划-黄仁勋把公司做成了一台-gpu/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsvMfNUbQHIotcpdW7zatTtld2rN.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0531</span></div>\n<h2>英偉達沒有五年計劃：黃仁勳把公司做成了一臺 GPU</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">黃仁勳的八條反常識管理法不是散點，而是一套分布式操作系統：60 個高管直接彙報、薪酬精確到一美分相同、不做一對一、不做計劃——組織溝通結構決定了產品架構。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">組織管理</span><span class=\"tag\">英偉達</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"65. 風險投資的鑰匙失靈了嗎？和夢秋聊：蟄伏、更少人的遊戲和齧齒動物 明股實債 check size power law foundation model AI for science AI for coding\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-04-22-zhangxiaojun-vc-的以小博大逻辑失效了-我们改做侏罗纪的老鼠/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhUr7NSTICDPYYFtoZ_vqhXUOnsI.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0422</span></div>\n<h2>VC 的以小博大邏輯失效了，我們改做侏羅紀的老鼠</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美元 VC 的募資端和退出端同時被掐斷，靠十個 check 裡中兩三個的槓桿故事講不下去了。清流資本的選擇是：要麼投一兩年就能變現的現在學，要麼投七到十年的未來學，中間地帶最難。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">風險投資</span><span class=\"tag\">AI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"64. 和廣密聊AGI大基建時代：電+芯片=產出智能 Scaling Law Agent 主權 AI T5T Killer App\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-04-17-zhangxiaojun-agi-是马拉松-物理硬件成了最大瓶颈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn7FJcpPfyVxXw_flcSs59BrOes_.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:21:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0417</span></div>\n<h2>AGI 是馬拉松：物理硬件成了最大瓶頸</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">去年以為加 GPU 加數據就能到 AGI，今年發現單數據中心加到 3.2 萬卡就撞牆，美國能源基建還是四五十年前規劃的——AGI 時間表被物理世界拖長了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AGI</span><span class=\"tag\">算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"62. 你們要的朱嘯虎，來了 PMF Llama POC C2C 視頻電話\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-04-01-zhangxiaojun-朱啸虎-中国-aigc-应用已经大爆发-只是都藏在-to-b-里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq8dPRQOFu-GwJwUX4lpT5hPuYUj.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">52:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0401</span></div>\n<h2>朱嘯虎：中國 AIGC 應用已經大爆發，只是都藏在 to B 裡</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">朱嘯虎說中國 AIGC 應用已經大爆發，只是都發生在企業服務裡：外賣意外險賠付率從 150 塊降到 60 塊，視頻面試一年做到 100 萬人次，消費者根本看不見。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AIGC</span><span class=\"tag\">風險投資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"58. 和吳曉波聊中國企業家小史：如果未來沒有大生意，年輕人不如過自己喜歡的人生 越級創業 匠人型企業家 企業家經濟\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-02-01-zhangxiaojun-未来可能没有大生意-年轻人不如过自己喜欢的人生/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhtqzaMnG4zhagUglE-24-SpVe9d.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">41:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0201</span></div>\n<h2>未來可能沒有大生意，年輕人不如過自己喜歡的人生</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">吳曉波把改革開放後的創業者分成六波，第六波最奇怪：高速發展結束、市場飽和、這一代是有產階級的孩子。他判斷未來大部分創業是小創業，AI 有通吃性，不會帶來所有人的機會。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業家</span><span class=\"tag\">創業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"55. 與小Lin的線下活動｜不可控週期中，提高微小個體的生命質量 non-farm payroll Content Marketing hikikomori\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-01-05-zhangxiaojun-你羡慕的大佬都是幸存者-九成创业公司活不过三年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgsnyi7RH1mUllSFmzyF10piv_Tk.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">55:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0105</span></div>\n<h2>你羨慕的大佬都是倖存者，九成創業公司活不過三年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">小Lin說大佬的共性是「膽」，敢擔風險。但這是倖存者視角：創業九成的公司活不過三年，跑出來的人承擔的風險被高光遮住了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">內容創作</span><span class=\"tag\">投行</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"44. 談諾貝爾經濟獎與40+消失在黃金階梯上的女人 greedy jobs quiet revolution marriage bar statistical discrimination\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-10-28-zhangxiaojun-女性职场起步领先-生育惩罚却把优势磨光/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvytLxa9AF85a65Xh4b4KfK6zegX.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">53:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>女性職場起步領先，生育懲罰卻把優勢磨光</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">剛畢業時男女就業參與率幾乎一樣，過十年女性就落下來了，再過十幾年又部分回去——這條曲線與生育時間高度吻合。被磨掉的不是能力，是連續的積累。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">性別經濟學</span><span class=\"tag\">生育懲罰</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"42.【汽車史話02】集權者福特與全球第二暢銷T型車的衰落 vertical integration\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-10-18-zhangxiaojun-t型车曾占全球市场一半-却因19年不换代被通用取代/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fok7EeXlkZbGUo_I_4yjUSRj_fId.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">50:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1018</span></div>\n<h2>T型車曾佔全球市場一半，卻因19年不換代被通用取代</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">福特靠一款車讓普通人買得起汽車，T型車一度佔據全球汽車銷量的一半以上；但正因為它只有一個品種、一個顏色、十九年不換代，消費者沒有換車的理由，市場被通用拿走。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽車史</span><span class=\"tag\">福特</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"41.【汽車史話01】世界上第一輛燃油車、女車手和慈禧太后 Red Flag Act Otto cycle Whiz Kids\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-10-15-zhangxiaojun-汽车只是马车上加个发动机-马车公司却一家没活下来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhyzEVB3fH4klo9wdF0MApq4AanO.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">51:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>汽車只是馬車上加個發動機，馬車公司卻一家沒活下來</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">汽車不是馬車上加一臺發動機那麼簡單：動力總成換了，整個技術棧和市場跟著換，當年造車廂的馬車公司沒有一家活過百年。今天衡量電動車企，看的是它能不能掌控上游的電池。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽車史</span><span class=\"tag\">內燃機</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"29. 逆全球化思潮來勢洶洶，外企CEO何故密集訪華？ CDR 紅籌架構 FDI 國際版\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-06-12-zhangxiaojun-外企ceo密集访华-逆全球化是政治问题-不是经济问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkFcghZx7pOjDfhfU5E5McOkP2vv.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">50:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0612</span></div>\n<h2>外企CEO密集訪華：逆全球化是政治問題，不是經濟問題</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">逆全球化來勢洶洶卻擋不住CEO們排隊來華，因為脫鉤違反經濟規律；但真正推動脫鉤的不是經濟邏輯，而是老大防老二的政治邏輯。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中美關係</span><span class=\"tag\">外資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"25. OpenAI開源、亞馬遜新動作，全球大模型格局走向何方 vertical copilot LLM transformer\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-05-16-zhangxiaojun-大模型底层战争已结束-垂直副驾驶才是老炮的机会/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjWbXr0EmbCnVlAiw7xIvuYsgtxC.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">55:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0516</span></div>\n<h2>大模型底層戰爭已結束，垂直副駕駛才是老炮的機會</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">底層大模型是年輕人借微軟算力做出的湧現，但真正賺錢的行業副駕駛屬於創業老兵——三分之二的垂直機會已被ChatGPT自己幹掉，剩下的是數據、社交和商業模式的組合戰。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">垂直副駕駛</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"20. The Information前記者空降巴西，她的拉美商業遊記 warm intro growth VC fund Rappi Mafia The Edge of Democracy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-03-21-zhangxiaojun-巴西像七八年前的中国-但中间公司活不下来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrQ-nhLnqkTMm8pY3xNQqcz_cb_n.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">52:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0321</span></div>\n<h2>巴西像七八年前的中國，但中間公司活不下來</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">巴西的稅收和勞工法讓大公司和小團隊都能活，唯獨中間規模的公司被夾死；政治左右搖擺本身是確定的，創業者把它當成可控制的變量。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出海</span><span class=\"tag\">拉美</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"19. 硅谷銀行危機未結束：未來風險傳導的3個可能 FDIC MBS beginning of the end end of the beginning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-03-15-zhangxiaojun-硅谷银行倒闭-美联储只保存款人-不保股东/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm1kKnPtJWMzDCIstwB9k7krx12a.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">36:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0315</span></div>\n<h2>硅谷銀行倒閉：美聯儲只保存款人，不保股東</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美聯儲做了一個黑白分明的決定：三萬戶機構存款人全額保護，股東血本無歸。這不是雷曼時刻，而是一個時間差——但美國信譽的慢性下滑可能才剛開始。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硅谷銀行</span><span class=\"tag\">美聯儲</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"6. 顯微鏡下的硅谷大裁員：一筆筆現實經濟賬 Level.FYI Cobra H1B P&amp;L IC\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-11-21-zhangxiaojun-meta-裁员补偿-4-n-2-有绿卡是幸福-没绿卡是倒计时/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhc35VOmgPTfIMmG3h6NJdwkPlfZ.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">33:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1121</span></div>\n<h2>Meta 裁員補償 4+N/2：有綠卡是幸福，沒綠卡是倒計時</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">同一場 Meta 裁員，有綠卡的人拿著十幾萬美金去新公司上班，沒綠卡的人要在四個月內、還是節假日窗口裡找到下一份工作，否則就得離開美國。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硅谷裁員</span><span class=\"tag\">Meta</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"3. 宇航員與機器人：漫談深邃浪漫的ROBOT新知 in-hand manipulation DARPA Robotic Challenge silver bullet product market fit DLR\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-10-10-zhangxiaojun-让机器人削个土豆就能当院士-这比登火星更难/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqx2soYz782O4451-l7klWL-MdkO.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">58:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1010</span></div>\n<h2>讓機器人削個土豆就能當院士，這比登火星更難</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">登火星的技術人類大部分已經有了，只是個經濟問題；但怎麼讓機器人在廚房裡工作，人類現在還不知道，甚至還沒有思路——誰能讓機器人削個土豆，可以當院士。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">機器人</span><span class=\"tag\">人形機器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"2. 和曹巍聊聊馬斯克、機器人恐怖谷和《西部世界》 uncanny valley iToF SLAM 力控\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-10-03-zhangxiaojun-人形机器人最难的环节不是走路-是穿针剥虾/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frwlq1h1luJuh--l7ns3xS7_zVUT.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">55:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1003</span></div>\n<h2>人形機器人最難的環節不是走路，是穿針剝蝦</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">雙足行走和自主導航都能沿襲特斯拉自動駕駛的積累，精準力控和觸覺不能——那要模擬人的皮膚，開車時根本用不到。第一版、第二版機器人大概只到人的 20% 到 30%。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人形機器人</span><span class=\"tag\">特斯拉</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"1. 和投資人夢秋聊聊加州、投資寒潮和林黛玉 Bubble Burst 持幣待購\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-07-11-zhangxiaojun-资本寒冬不是缺钱-是大家都在持币待购/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FohANge6xUKNJYHcFrR36QdyZQbQ.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">54:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0711</span></div>\n<h2>資本寒冬不是缺錢，是大家都在持幣待購</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">「資本寒冬」每兩三年就被喊一次，通常六到八個月就過去。這次不一樣：兩頭在外的美元通路被打斷，不是沒錢，而是不知道該怎麼投。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">一級市場</span><span class=\"tag\">資本寒冬</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"串臺《硅谷101》｜TikTok如何在Facebook眼皮底下成長起來？ UP 值 UG 中臺 Lasso\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-05-16-zhangxiaojun-tiktok-在-facebook-眼皮底下长大-靠的不是产品而是体系/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuG7h07tc_--MRpcmkfgLxmZb9-O.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">38:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0516</span></div>\n<h2>TikTok 在 Facebook 眼皮底下長大，靠的不是產品而是體系</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">字節贏在體系而非個人：推薦算法、UG 中臺、商業化三套系統疊加 Musical.ly 的產品殼，再用對標 Facebook 的 UP 值打法下狠手投放，才跑出全球第五大社交應用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出海</span><span class=\"tag\">TikTok</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"《TikTok內幕：張一鳴的巨浪征途》音頻版（下集） UG PMO GDPR All-Hands Meeting\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-05-05-zhangxiaojun-不留空档全面压制-tiktok-花-100-亿美元砸出护城河/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsmh-73nZbOXpxwKYaADw0enBwmo.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">45:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0505</span></div>\n<h2>不留空檔全面壓制：TikTok 花 100 億美元砸出護城河</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">TikTok 全球化的第一推力是錢和一條暗號：幾年間投入約 100 億美元買量、補貼內容、砸服務器，對手要攔至少得準備 200 到 300 億美元。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">字節跳動</span><span class=\"tag\">TikTok</span>\n</div></div></a>"]